fix(buscar cards): move ver-horario below schedule (centered), reviews count-only link, drop casos/cert counts, mobile height floor

- "Ver horario completo" now sits centered BELOW the schedule grid instead of
  the top-right header row, so it no longer collides with the card bookmark on
  desktop; location control becomes a conditional location-only row.
- Reviews: only the "N reseñas" count is the link now; star + rating value are
  plain text.
- Casos de éxito / Certificaciones links drop the (N) count; certifications
  link stays conditional on having certifications.
- Card gets a mobile min-h floor (min-h-[320px]) for uniform height; desktop
  keeps md:min-h-[190px].
- card.email / profile.email -> "Contactar por correo" (EN "Contact by email").

